<title>NETHERLANDS: Rabo's Lage Landen 1996 net slightly up.</title>
<headline>Rabo's Lage Landen 1996 net slightly up.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996 (in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    30    vs  29</p>
<p>    Total income (billion)	   1.48   vs 1.28</p>
<p>    Operating costs		    190    vs 167</p>
<p>    Loan loss provisions		36    vs  24</p>
<p>NOTE - Financial services group De Lage Landen International BV, a fully-owned subsidiary of cooperative Rabobank Nederland, said its 1996 profit growth had been depressed by provisions taken in Germany, France and Italy.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
